Patches to libcosmic's bundled iced (the `iced/` folder of the libcosmic
checkout, its own git repository). Applied in order with
`git -C <libcosmic>/iced apply` by packaging/arch/PKGBUILD to every
libcosmic copy that is built: Lapin UX's own crates (private cargo home
`cargo-lapin`) and the Settings fork (`cargo-settings`).

- 0001: screen readers can read libcosmic apps (#44). Changes nothing
  unless the `a11y` feature is on.
- 0002: a program may pick which windows are redrawn after a batch of
  messages (`iced::window::REDRAW_FILTER`). Lapin UX's shell uses it to
  redraw only the surfaces that move during an animation (#51). Unset (as
  in Settings), every window is redrawn, as before.

In a sandbox: apply to ~/.cargo/git/checkouts/libcosmic-*/430f3d4/iced,
then `cargo clean -p iced_core -p iced_winit -p iced_widget` before
building (cargo doesn't notice changes inside git checkouts).
